{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f My wife is a real estate agent \u2014 a candid visual novel about desires, boundaries, and temptations hidden behind the facade of a perfect marriage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are her husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a beautiful, confident woman who sells expensive real estate and seems to be flirting with clients more and more often.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcde It all starts with innocent conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc84 Then \u2014 late apartment viewings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b And soon you hear strange noises coming from the shower when you come home earlier than usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d In the game you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Hot sex scenes<br>\ud83d\udc60 An elegant and liberated wife<br>\ud83c\udfad Emotional dialogues<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Atmospheric music <br>\ud83d\udca5 High-quality renders<br><br>\ud83d\udda4 Your wife is changing before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel control slipping away, and instead of being her husband, you become a spectator to her games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\u200d\ud83d\udde8 Accept your role as a cuckold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe that's what excites you the most?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Open House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3903110/5a6f42f09296f5ccbaea7a64809de2a925a0d166.jpg"},{"name":"Good Deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3903110/9f8d2513cac1459972ed8d357d426e34052304a2.jpg"},{"name":"The customer is always right","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3903110/d8bdf04d351c112